": "<h2>How to play:</h2>\n<p>Take it in turns to clap a pattern for the other person to copy.</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">Start with some simple patterns (e.g. clap, clap, clap) where there isn’t too much to think about, and then move onto some more complicated patterns.</span>&nbsp;</p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 228718742, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 1, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 113777275, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<h2>How to play:</h2>\n<p>Take it in turns to clap a pattern for the other person to copy.</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">Start with some simple patterns (e.g. clap, clap, clap) where there isn’t too much to think about, and then move onto some more complicated patterns.</span>&nbsp;</p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 113777749, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null]